{:edb/db-before-t 1562 :edb/db-after-t 1563 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534875 50 #inst "2026-10-12T22:21:24.027Z" 13194139534875 17592186045417 true] [17592186198414 1038 #edb/ref 17592186442218 13194139534875 17592186045417 true] [17592186198632 1068 #edb/ref 17592186194423 13194139534875 17592186045417 false] [17592186401405 1071 "For the transformation $f:{R}^{2}\\to {R}^{3},$ defined as\n\n$$\nf(x)=[\\begin{aligned}xy \\\\ {x}^{2}-y \\\\ \\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy)\\end{aligned}],\\,x=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}],\n$$\n\nthe total derivative ${f}^{′}$ is given by \n\n$$\n{f}^{′}(x)=[\\begin{aligned}y & \\bbox[3pt,border: 1pt solid black]{\\phantom{AA}} \\\\ \\bbox[3pt,border: 1pt solid black]{\\phantom{AA}} & -1 \\\\ \\bbox[3pt,border: 1pt solid black]{\\phantom{AA}} & x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(xy)\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFrom top to bottom, what are the missing entries?" 13194139534875 17592186045417 true] [17592186401405 1071 "For the transformation $f:{R}^{2}\\to {R}^{3},$ defined as\n\n$$\nf(x)=[\\begin{aligned}xy \\\\ {x}^{2}-y \\\\ \\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy)\\end{aligned}],\\,x=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}],\n$$\n\nthe total derivative ${f}^{′}$ is given by \n\n$$\n{f}^{′}(x)=[\\begin{aligned}y & \\boxed{} \\\\ \\boxed{} & -1 \\\\ \\boxed{} & x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(xy)\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFrom top to bottom, what are the missing entries?" 13194139534875 17592186045417 false] [17592186442211 1043 #edb/ref 17592186442219 13194139534875 17592186045417 true] [17592186442211 1043 #edb/ref 17592186442220 13194139534875 17592186045417 true] [17592186442211 1043 #edb/ref 17592186442221 13194139534875 17592186045417 true] [17592186442211 1043 #edb/ref 17592186442222 13194139534875 17592186045417 true] [17592186442211 1043 #edb/ref 17592186442223 13194139534875 17592186045417 true] [17592186442211 1044 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534875 17592186045417 true] [17592186442211 1045 "The Derivative of a Multivariable Function" 13194139534875 17592186045417